    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "82ff5fbebd144f19bc9d0386daa2860f",
    "m_Title": "Opaque Transparent",
    "m_Content": "As don't need the intermedita transparency is it better to keep opaque and just shrink or displace down below level floor?\n\nAdd alpha clip theshold block so that no shadows from transparent\n\nSome issue with depth sorting seems to happen with that transparency option with alpha and alpha clip thershold to sort shadows",
